2.
Definitions.
- In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Tripura Agricultural Debtors Relief Act, 1975;
(b)
"Form" means a Form appended to these rules;
(c)
"Code" means the Code of Civil Procedure, 1908;
(d)
"Section" means the section of the Act;
(e)
"Tribunal" means a Tribunal as may be established by the State Government under Section 5 of the Act;
(f)
words and expressions used in these rules but not defined shall have the meaning assigned to them in the Act.
